{"productId": "6c2aadf0-740a-4d0b-a9a5-dc7fb6d4b6fe", "modelName": "600+ Trail", "modelDescription": "The CZ 600+ Trail is a compact and versatile bolt-action rifle designed for shooters who need mobility without sacrificing performance. Built on a lightweight aluminum receiver with a free-floating forend, it features a long Picatinny rail and M-LOK slots for mounting optics and accessories. The Trail is fitted with a four-position telescoping stock that collapses to under 27 inches, making it easy to carry and store in tight spaces. AR-style controls, including an ambidextrous safety and magazine release, provide familiar handling, while compatibility with AR-15 magazines in .223 Remington and CZ BREN 2 magazines in 7.62\u00d739 enhances versatility. A three-lug bolt with a short 60-degree throw ensures smooth cycling, supported by CZ\u2019s controlled-feed system for reliable operation. Ergonomics are enhanced with an AR-compatible pistol grip and interchangeable backstraps, while the adjustable trigger allows for a personalized shooting experience. Finished with CZ\u2019s durable nitriding process, the CZ 600+ Trail combines accuracy, portability, and rugged construction, making it a practical choice for hunters, sport shooters, and outdoor adventurers alike.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "5cf7febe-f1d9-4904-9a1a-72ba5fc79d86", "description": "CZ, 600+ Trail, Bolt Action, 300 Blackout, 16\" Threaded Barrel, Blued Finish, M-LOK Handguard, Collapsible PDW Stock, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/b1691036-17e9-41dd-b2af-b9f6df32b276", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/597bffe0-6a32-4a21-a889-3ed6927c9b58", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/17e4379f-e222-4a9c-be43-bd14ecdceb08", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3c6a0760-8312-43f7-b346-aaeedc026b63